{"version":1,"content":"<p>中年脫髮與身形走樣是不少男士的噩夢，但現年71歲的影帝周潤發（發哥）卻憑極致自律逆轉歲月！</p><p>身為圈中養生達人的他，近日在香港一家髮型屋被網民野生捕獲，其狀態與該店剪髮收費隨即引發網民熱議。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;當日發哥貫</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:43.682447+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.884335+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.884335+00:00","content_hash":"e58c0929c0fd1b6151c0b55fa0e2f46baf56136f604b2fdb4aa6b3cf0eb91b56","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}